	steps = {
		{
			title = "{npc:14724}, the cloth quartermaster",
			note = "{npc:14724} takes cloth for the {faction:54}; he stands in {object:171524} in {zone:1455}, by the tram. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7812} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Commons is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do {zone:1426} (levels 1-12) and {npc:4077}'s quests in Stonetalon (20-25) while you level. After the donations come {npc:9616}'s ooze quests and {quest:4262} (400), then the optional {zone:1426} hubs, best rate first: {area:132} (about 38 a minute at full value), {area:131} (26), the quarry (17). Every {area:133} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.",
