	steps = {
		{
			title = "{npc:14723}, the cloth quartermaster",
			note = "{npc:14723} takes cloth for {faction:47}; she stands outside the clothier on the north side of the {object:32372}, among the tailors. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7806} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Commons is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do {zone:1426} (levels 1-12), {zone:1432} (10-20) and the {zone:1437} (20-30) while you level through them. After the donations come the level 52-59 quests of the {zone:1428} and {zone:1452} (about 600), then the optional {zone:1426} hubs, best rate first: {area:132} (about 37 a minute at full value), {area:131} (26), the quarry (17). Every {faction:47} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1457} and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.",
